<task id="081" project="ebilling-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>RuleSetService scope validation, scope lock, BU writes, routed ownership; id-keyed route checks; Draft re-scope; sprk_ruleset joins the secure family in one change; census Waived to Routed; guard and twin guard</title>
    <phase>3 Rules (WP3) — rule-set scope (D-171, D-172, D-141), wave W3-7</phase>
    <gate>080 done; owner OK for the live refusal probe and the two -Apply runs on dev (step 9)</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Authorization (a new Read + AppendTo operation key; a server-read record check on every id-keyed route), record ownership routing and re-filing on Secure records, the shared ownership census, uac-r2 lineage, role and depth-assertion files, and live role and schema writes on dev: auth and tenant-isolation code.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Security-relevant (auth, secure-wall ownership, F3 on a move out of Secure) across files owned by two other projects (uac-r2 lineage, role set, census, depth assertion; ontology-owned guard and policy tables), with binding review conditions from both.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Edits uac-r2 files (SecureChildLineage.cs, RecordOwnershipResolver.cs, config/secure-record-owner-role.json, SecureBuRoleDepthAssertion.cs, RecordCreatorPerson.cs, scripts/Set-ChildRecordCreatorPersonSchema.ps1) and the shared RecordOwnerAssignmentCensusTests, RefileWriterAfterRefileGuardTests and RouteAuthorizationGuardTests; 086 edits the same files after it. Run /conflict-check before the PR.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>080</deps>
    <tags>bff, api, auth, security, tenant-isolation, testing, rules</tags>
    <estimated-effort>3-4 days</estimated-effort>
